s side) (w.projective side)\n   315\t    (fun pair => fixedBinTrace P.model\n   316\t      (P.model.basis j * dotProduct (decodeFq (W.selectPoly pair)) u))\n   317\t  simp only [MagicSquareRigidity.signObs, ← phaseSign_eq_complex_bitSign] at hsquare\n   318\t  rw [tildeObs_eq_heteroKron, heteroKron_mul, hsquare, tauObservable_sq,\n   319\t    heteroKron_one_one]\n   320\t\n   321\t/-- The corrected twisted commutation relation for pulled-apart observables.\n   322\tThis is Equation `eq:tildew-twisted-commutation` in blueprint\n   323\t`eq:tildew-twisted-commutation`, correcting paper\n   324\t`14_analysis_of_the_pauli_basis_test.tex:1451-1456`.\n   325\t\n   326\t**Local fix:** the paper drops this phase when `j != j'`, which is false for\n   327\tgeneral register vectors; see `docs/paper-gaps/qpbt_cross-basis-phase.tex`.\n   328\tThe sign-weighted sums of the joint projectors commute, leaving exactly the\n   329\tphase of `tauObservable_X_mul_Z`. -/\n   330\ttheorem tildeObs_twisted_commutation {P : AdmissibleParams}\n   331\t    {epsilon delta : ℝ} {S : ProjectiveSetting P epsilon}\n   332\t    (w : GlobalPairWitness S delta) (side : PlayerSide)\n   333\t    (u v : PauliRegister P) (j j' : Fin P.model.basisDim) :\n   334\t    tildeObs w side .X u j * tildeObs w side .Z v j' =\n   335\t      phaseSign (fixedBinTrace P.model\n   336\t        (P.model.basis j * P.model.basis j' * dotProduct u v)) •\n   337\t        (tildeObs w side .Z v j' * tildeObs w side .X u j) := by\n   338\t  classical\n   339\t  have hcomm := MagicSquareRigidity.signObs_comm\n   340\t    (w.Smeas side) (w.projective side)\n   341\t    (fun pair => fixedBinTrace P.model\n   342\t      (P.model.basis j * dotProduct (decodeFq (PauliKind.X.selectPoly pair)) u))\n   343\t    (fun pair => fixedBinTrace P.model\n   344\t      (P.model.basis j' * dotProduct (decodeFq (PauliKind.Z.selectPoly pair)) v))\n   345\t  simp only [MagicSquareRigidity.signObs, ← phaseSign_eq_complex_bitSign] at hcomm\n   346\t